window.products.push({"id":497096,"name":"Black and White Tapestry + LED String Lights - Mandala Tapestry Wall Hanging for Bedroom Livingroom, Bohemian Hippie Tapestry Wall Decor 78.7 x 59 inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XCJJH2zuS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Features Dimensions: 78.7\" x 59\" Material: Black and white tapestry made of upgraded polyester fiber. Style: Bohemian tapestry. Shape: rectangle. product description Color: Black and white 78.7\" x 59\" The pattern uses 3D high-definition printing, with soft colors and clear lines, bringing lasting individual colors to your room. Shipping list Wall hanging tapestry*1, Installation Package*1 (Non-marking Nail*2, Hook*2), Light String*1(The length is about 6 meters) Convenient to use or maintain Use the nails and hooks in the installation kit to easily hang wall hangings. Hand wash in cold water, just hang dry. Please iron at a lower temperature. Purchase Notes Due to manual measurement, the product size may have an error of 1-2 cm, which is within the acceptable range. Due to the difference in light, angle and display contrast, there will be a slight color difference. The LED light string is only used indoors and should not be exposed to water. In addition, the star decoration on the light string adopts a detachable design, if it falls off, glue it together. Tips Since the tapestry is sent out folded, there may be creases when you receive it. You can reduce the crease with the following methods. 1.Use a low temperature iron to iron the back of the tapestry (the side with no pattern). 2.Roll it up tightly with a cylinder and leave it for 3-4 days. 3.Blow the back of the tapestry with a hair dryer (blow with hot air, and be careful not to get too hot)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XCJJH2zuS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GF","source_asin":"B08L3KDLTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L3KDLTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L3KDLTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
