window.products.push({"id":497194,"name":"Momcozy PE Hose Pregnancy Pillows, Full Body Pillow Adjustable 3D Strong Support for Sleeping with Removable Cover, 55 Inch, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IBF1Vgb+L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Air Layer Fabric NEW ARRIVAL- Firm & 3D Strong Support - Different from other pillows filled with polyester, we choose high-tech soft PE hose filling material. It is feature with recyclable, environmental friendly, 3D strong support and not easy to deform. Choose a pillow that providing utmost relief and comfort while never loses shape, bends, or contorts. Ergonomic and Adjustable – shapes to your body throughout all stages of pregnancy and beyond. Offering a unique 5-point support and comfort where you need it the most: belly, pelvis, lower back, knees and ankles. The hose has the feature of high fluidity, you can adjust the height and position of the filling at will. Deeply Sleep With Momcozy Pillow - Our pregnancy body pillow helps improve blood circulation and releases your body pressure. Providing exceptional comfort, pain relief, and quality rest for expecting mothers. Perfect also as nursing pillow, back pillow. Support Entire Pillow Washing - Simply separate the pillowcase and pillow core, the pillowcase is machine washable, the pillow core is recommended to be rinsed with water to keep it clean, and you don't even have to worry about it getting misshapen. RECYCLABLE - Our body pllow is filling with soft PE hose, which can be fully recycled and reused. So, you also can take some hose out and use it as a cervical pillow and others after you don't want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IBF1Vgb+L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Momcozy","source_asin":"B0BMFZW8KY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMFZW8KY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMFZW8KY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
