window.products.push({"id":497203,"name":"Start Brewing Perfect Iced Coffee & Tea w/Our Cold Brew Coffee Maker, Pitcher for Fridge (34oz) - Air Tight Seal, Measuring Label - Stainless Steel Ic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X8AaJkQwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPERIOR TASTE: With its precise brewing process, you can extract the most robust flavors from your coffee grounds, resulting in a refreshing cold brew all from the comfort of your own home EASY TO USE and CLEAN: Simplify brewing and cleanup with our cold brew coffee pitcher. Convenient and user friendly, brew effortlessly in 4 steps. Clean by hand using warm water and dish soap HIGH QUALITY DESIGN: Our iced tea brewer surpasses US FDA and EU safety standards. Laser cut filter keeps grounds out; airtight seals prevent spills. Our ice coffee maker is built for longevity VERSATILE BREWING OPTIONS: The possibilities are endless and you'll never get bored with our coffee kit. Use it as a cold brew maker, iced tea maker, or for fruit infused water or wine PORTABLE and CONVENIENT: Unlike electric iced coffee makers, our ice coffee machine fits in the fridge or cooler. The cold brew coffee pot lets you enjoy cold drinks anywhere; no electricity needed LESS ACIDIC THAN HOT COFFEE: Our cold coffee brewer is ideal for those who get heartburn from hot coffee as the ice coffee making process provides a tasty alternative that won't cause discomfort GLASS COLD BREW PITCHER: The cold brew coffee maker glass carafe withstands temperature changes, preserving fresh flavor. Built in measuring label ensures consistent, perfect results every time INVEST IN BETTER VALUE: Invest in our cold brew kit to enjoy iced coffee and tea at a fraction of the expense while also reducing the waste generated by coffee maker single serve coffee pods PERFECT GIFT IDEA: Cold brew coffee press can be gifted at any occasion. Whether it's a birthday, anniversary, or just because, our cold brew pitcher is the perfect add on to your household gadgets","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X8AaJkQwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cafe Du Chateau","source_asin":"B087LZGVWP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087LZGVWP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087LZGVWP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
