window.products.push({"id":497213,"name":"Variable Floating Shelves Set of 4, Bathroom Shelves 28.35\" Max, Rustic Wood Shelves for Wall Decor, Wall Mounted Shelves for Living Room Bedroom Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vz15BIL9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Variable Design】The floating shelf adopts mortise and tenon construction. It only needs to fix the main frame on the wall, and the other boards can be freely combined into eight shapes, which can be changed at any time without causing secondary damage to the wall and avoiding aesthetic fatigue. 【Changeable Storage Space】Different combination shapes create various space sizes so that our wall shelves can accommodate higher ornaments, 8.6 inches-18.2 inches or more. However, other floating shelves cannot store larger size ornaments once they are fixed. 【Perfect Shelves for Wall Decor】Our floating shelves can be used as bathroom shelves to hold cosmetics and Toiletries, as kitchen shelves to store spices and jars, or as wall shelves for living room to display trophies and accolades, and as shelves for bedroom to display your family photos. No matter where the rustic shelf is installed, it is beautiful scenery. 【Robust and Durable】Our wall shelves are made of solid pine with a carbonized surface for durability. The hidden metal brackets ensure that the shelf fits perfectly with the wall, and the boards are connected to the main frame with a double mortise and tenon structure to ensure the stability of the boards without tilting. 【Gift Attributes】One product, eight shapes, excellent quality, the floating shelf is the most creative gift for your friends, no visual fatigue, always keep the happiness of life. If you have any quality problems after receiving the goods, please contact us promptly and we will replace it for you free of charge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vz15BIL9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yaqew","source_asin":"B0B2LLRWZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2LLRWZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2LLRWZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":497214,"name":"Entertaining with Caspari Winter Birds Luncheon Napkin, Pack of 20","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1sG3LqDKqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Entertaining with Caspari Winter Birds Luncheon Napkins. Dress up your table everyday by adding a touch of elegance. Our beautifully designed Luncheon Napkins are the perfect decorative accent to make your table a place your guests will want to linger. Our Luncheon Napkins are printed in Germany using non-toxic, water-soluble dyes, making them biodegradable and compostable. Disposability makes clean-up a snap so you have more time to enjoy the party. The soft, yet strong 3-ply tissue has the look and feel of linen without the maintenance. Sold in a pack of 20, Each individually folded napkin measures 6-1/2-Inch square and opens to 13-Inch square. Finish the look with other items from our coordinating high-end paper table top collection. Includes paper plates, additional napkins, guest towels and cups – finally, add our acrylic stemware and top quality pillar and taper candles. Caspari-bringing beauty, style and convenience into your home every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1sG3LqDKqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caspari","source_asin":"B01CV90PO8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CV90PO8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CV90PO8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":497215,"name":"Enesco Children of The Inner Light Friends Precious Moments Dish Cloth Tea Towel, 26 Inch, Black and White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RhKhvKd9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Children of the Inner Light offers a coordinated collection of giftware that conveys heartfelt, recipient driven messages of love, acceptance and gratitude. Designed with wonderful characters that reflect our inner spirits, this collection reminds us that \"the bonds we have are everlasting\". Each item is adorned with a heartfelt message of love, acceptance and gratitude towards the receiver, making it the perfect gift for family and friends! Friendships can be messy, and so can the home! This tea towel is made from 100% cotton and heartwarming. With a sweet sketch and moving message, it's a daily reminder of gratitude for your bestie. Keep making memories together, in and out of the kitchen. About Us: Enesco is committed to BRING JOY EVERY DAY. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Things Remembered, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Designs by Lolita, Our Name is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RhKhvKd9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B0842FSH8F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842FSH8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842FSH8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":497216,"name":"Nesco Gwk-57, 1.7-Liter Glass Water Kettle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vVv0-FZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This electric kettle can quickly bring water to a rolling boil faster and more efficiently than a stovetop or microwave oven. To use, simply fill the kettle at the sink using the water-level indicator on either side to gauge how much, return the kettle to its 360-degree rotational power base, put it in and flip the switch to ON. In a matter of minutes hot water will be ready to use for anything from tea, hot cocoa, or instant coffee to hot cereal, instant soup, noodles to boxed macaroni and cheese, instant oatmeal and hot cereals, rice and even gelatin. The kettle provides a stay-cool handle, a drip-free pouring spout and a cordless design for graceful serving. Features include a cordless design for graceful serving, a maximum fill indicator, a concealed heating element, auto shut-off for safety, a removable water filter for easy cleaning. Great for in a kitchen, office or dorm room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vVv0-FZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nesco","source_asin":"B008H0GX2O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008H0GX2O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008H0GX2O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
