window.products.push({"id":497229,"name":"Mondo Cattolico Olive Wood Rosary with Enamel Centerpiece Medal of St. Benedict.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":90.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pXsI+hbyL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFUL SAINT BENEDICT ROSARY BEADS: A beautiful handmade olive wood rosary crafted in honor of St. Benedict, the patron saint of Europe. Handmade in Loreto, the Hail Mary beads are made from olive wood and the Our Father beads are made from Zamak with a blue and red enamel background. The rosary is strung on a brass chain and features an olive wood St. Benedict center medal and a crucifix with a red and blue enamel background. SAINT BENEDICT: St. Benedict is the patron saint of Europe, and his help is invoked against evil and vice. He protects against disease and bestows good health. He is considered one of the most popular saints of all times, yet several important details of the saint’s life are not well known. He is often portrayed as an old man, although he only lived to 67 years of age, and then died in a very unusual manner, standing upright. He attracted all kinds of people, from shepherd to scholars, and was able to convert even the most uncouth characters. FEATURES: Our rosary beads are all MADE IN ITALY and come with a white Mondo Cattolico box and bag. A simple item that provides comfort and a constant spiritual connection. Our rosary beads are all MADE IN ITALY and come with a white Mondo Cattolico box and bag. A simple item that provides comfort and a constant spiritual connection. The rosary is 19.29” in length and lightweight, yet durable enough to withstand stretching and pulling. The rosary is 19.29” in length and lightweight, yet durable enough to withstand stretching and pulling. What does olive wood symbolize? Olive wood comes from the olive, a beautiful tree with various symbolic meanings. It represents friendship and reconciliation, cleansing and healing, light, victory and richness. An olive branch is particularly recognized as a sign of peace. What does olive wood symbolize? Olive wood comes from the olive, a beautiful tree with various symbolic meanings. It represents friendship and reconciliation, cleansing and healing, light, victory and richness. An olive branch is particularly recognized as a sign of peace. The beads of this rosary fit comfortably in your hand and are not heavy. The beads of this rosary fit comfortably in your hand and are not heavy. SPECIFICATIONS: Material: Zamak, Olive wood. Material: Zamak, Olive wood. Size: 19\", 50 cm. Size: 19\", 50 cm. Color: Silver, Brown. Color: Silver, Brown. PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 x Set of Rosary Beads. 1 x Set of Rosary Beads. 1 x White Mondo Cattolico Case and Bag. 1 x White Mondo Cattolico Case and Bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pXsI+hbyL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mondo Cattolico","source_asin":"B0BBGJFXBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBGJFXBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBGJFXBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
