window.products.push({"id":497371,"name":"Arctic Cove MBF0181 18V Lithium Ion Powered Cooling Bucket Top Variable Speed Fan and Water Mister (18V Battery and Charger Included, 5 Gallon Bucket ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oFfKIcovL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It’s sunny out, and it’s hot enough that you could fry bacon on the hood of your car. You want to go out with your friends and family, but who wants to sit around in the sweltering heat all day? Fear not, because you’ve got the Arctic Cove Misting Fan. All you need is a 5 gallon bucket full of water. Plop the unit on top of the bucket, dip its pump into the water, and turn it on! The head is adjustable, so you can pick the perfect angle to spray a cooling mist across guests in your backyard or tailgate party. There are two speed settings which give you complete control over the experience, too. Don’t have a bucket, but still want to keep cool while you’re working around the outside of your house or business? If you have a standard sized garden hose, you’re covered! Screw the hose into the available slot and you’ll be able to keep cool for as long as the battery will last. Its included 2 Amp Hour lithium ion battery will keep air circulating and water flowing for up to two hours. It can work even longer if you upgrade to other, more powerful, 4 Amp Hour batteries. There are a wide variety of batteries for you to choose from in the Ryobi One+ system. The compatible model numbers include the P100, P102, P103, P104, P105, P107, and P108. Whether you’re at the beach, tanning at the park, or throwing a party in your backyard, the Arctic Cove Misting Fan will keep you covered and cool for many an occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oFfKIcovL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wemordu","source_asin":"B01HOVO87S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HOVO87S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HOVO87S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
