window.products.push({"id":497470,"name":"Andaz Press Lavender Watercolor Florals Table Tent Place Cards for Wedding Party Tables, Seating Name Place Cards, Scored for Easy Folding Tent Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EAB5JDg3L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Size: A full set of 56 folded place cards, these 2\" x 3.5\" tent cards can be used for any table setting. Select a design that coincides with your wedding decorations and add your text. Tented cards for a wedding are a personal touch to each reception table showing your guests to their respective seats. Tent cards can be propped up with guest names and table numbers. These small tent cards are printable and can be used for bridal showers, baby showers, birthday celebrations, and formal dinners. Material: Printed on 300 GSM folded place cardstock paper, these 2\" x 3.5\" table seating cards are the perfect size to place at each table setting for your wedding reception. These tent cards can be designed for many events and can match different decor styles. Placement table tent cards are perfect for organizing your guests and adds to the tablespace design. Printable place cards are tiny details that will complete the total wedding decor look. Made in the USA. Original design by Andaz Press. Wedding Decor: Wedding place cards are a big part of wedding seating charts. These 2\" x 3.5\" tented name cards come in many designs that compliment your wedding decorations. Match greenery table settings with similar wedding name cards. Select a woodland or tropical for a table name card design. Wedding seating charts can be well-decorated and gives a memorable touch. Use floral tent cards for bridal showers and match with the boho theme or select from the different floral styles. Quality Designs: Create unique reserved tented seating signs by choosing from several popular design themes. Frame guest names with an art deco design or go with a more rustic theme. Floral tented place cards add a nice touch to floral centerpieces. Reserved seating signs can incorporate the wedding colors like rose gold to navy. These fancy place cards can be purchased in bulk if the 56-pack is not enough. Table tent cards are used for more than just wedding seating. Plan a formal bridal shower and use table numbers on tent-style cards. Table placement cards can be used for tea parties, baby showers, and bridal showers. For the next holiday dinner, use place cards for the Christmas table. Or select from one of the many designs for the Thanksgiving dining table, Mother's Day brunch, or Easter. These tent cards can also be used for labeling flower arrangements or labeling food buffets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EAB5JDg3L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andaz Press","source_asin":"B0925SCBM7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0925SCBM7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0925SCBM7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
