window.products.push({"id":497472,"name":"Wishbone Chair - Wooden Dining Chair - Mid Century Style - Inspired by Hans Wegner (4, Beech & Natural Seat)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":999.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GDvSHJ2rL._AC_.jpg","description":"Perfect balance of style and comfort - As an exemplary masterpiece of the mid century modern design, Wishbone Chair is firmly located in the sweet spot between style and comfort, aesthetics and functionality. With this instantly recognizable model you will not only get a beautiful iconic design that holds an important place in the history of furniture design, but also a dining chair that is comfortable, lightweight and durable. Decor specialists' choice for years - From covers of lifestyle and interior design magazines to time-tested tips by the professionals in the business, Wishbone chair has been a quintessential element of professionally decorated interiors for decades. With its flowing, organic form, smooth and carefully thought-out lines, it has captivated the attention of professionals and layman alike. An ideal addition to any stylish dining room - Rich in vintage elegance and typical Scandinavian appeal, Wishbone chair is a perfect addition to any elegant home. It can easily fit in with numerous contemporary interior design styles and its unique form paired with natural appeal of wood ensure a perfectly balanced expression which is neither too minimalist, nor too rustic. As such, this model has already found its place in many homes across the world. The same style and elegance accompanied by industry-leading quality can now become a part of your home too. Comfort and integrity ensured by expertise - From the characteristic single-piece backrest shaped through a long process of carefully timed steam-bending to hand-woven paper cord seat and manual assembly of the finished design, each Wishbone chair is born on the intersection of rich legacy of mid century design and unprecedented expertise of our craftsmen. The expert manual assembly ensures optimal joinery and prevents the structure from ever becoming loose, thus ensuring not just exceptional comfort, but also the durability and structural integrity of the chair.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GDvSHJ2rL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"by BESPOEK","source_asin":"B07TRNQNJY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TRNQNJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TRNQNJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
