window.products.push({"id":497502,"name":"Empire Art Direct White Horse 2 Frameless Tempered Glass Black and White Wall Art, 48\" x 32\" x 0.2\", Ready to Hang","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":140.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d72s3mRrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About EADEmpire Art Direct has a long rich history of manufacturing wall art and home furnishings since 1948. At EAD, we are proud to be creating the best decorative products on the market. Our decoratives are over 1,000 designs, EAD has a variety of wall decorative for all moments in your life.Features• Item Name: Empire Art Direct \"Blanco Stallion Horse\" Frameless Free Floating Tempered Glass Panel Graphic Wall Art• Model Name: White Horse• Color: Black, White• Style: Contemporary• Meterial: Tempered Glass• Technics: Digital super high resolution HD printing is manufactured on the reverse side of the ultra white glass.Featuring Crystallus ultra white tempered glass that is designed to enhance depth and colors unlike conventional commercial glass. This frameless, free-floating, reverse printed, tempered art glass decor can be hung on any wall horizontally. Actual prints colors may be slightly different from pictures shown online due to different monitors. • Packing: Packing with styrofoam in every side and protective corners in carton.• Product Size & Weight: 48 in. x 32 in. x 0.2 in. & 25.6 lbs• Package Size & Weight: 50.8 in. x 35.2 in. x 2 in. & 27.6 lbsDecorationThis gorgeous white horse seems to be peering back at you, perhaps daring you to try to ride it. The horse appears out of the stark white background and mixes into the foreground like some ethereal beast. Pieces such as this really come to life when created in the Vetro De Arte style. The piece is painted on one side of a piece of glass and then viewed from the other.This brings out wonderful detail in the horse’s mane and eyes.About returns policy and our servicesIf you are not satisfied with our product or order wrong item, please let us know immediately, we will offer you the best services.Check out Empire Art Direct for more choices!ORDER NOW!DON'T MISS OUT, LIMITED STOCK!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d72s3mRrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empire Art Direct","source_asin":"B0C497VGW2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C497VGW2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C497VGW2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
