window.products.push({"id":497637,"name":"Bengenta Wooden Farmhouse Wall Clock 18 inch Noiseless Silent Non-Ticking Vintage Wall Clock - Large 3D Roman Numerals Retro Rustic Country Decorative","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GanFXSlFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌳【Solid wood and metal]】18IN, wall clock dial made of 100% environmental solid wood, durable, long service life. Our wall clock doesn't break easily because of thick fir. The dial is 1 inch thick. The entire circular metal frame and hands are black, adding a sense of utility to the wall clock. A rustic metal frame protects the entire perimeter of the Cedar Bell, perfectly matched with the natural solid spruce, making it an elegant and composed work of art. 🐴【3D Big Roman Numerals】The numbers on the wall clock are specially designed. Choose Roman numerals instead of ordinary Arabic numerals. Even standing at a distance, large numbers can be clearly displayed. The color contrast between the numbers and the dial makes the numbers easy to read. If you're looking for a russy wooden clock that complements a retro interior, Bengenta hunging clock is your perfect choice. 🔇【Noiseless Silent Non-Ticking】traditional wall clock will make a \"tick\" sound when used, which can seriously disturb you and your family during sleep, study and work. Unlike our large wall clock, our large wall clock is completely silent, no second hand, elegant but simple, you can choose it and pay for it. ⏰【Easy to Hang Wall】Our wall clocks have no glass surface, so you can read the time clearly from all angles without any reflection. And the clock does not need to be assembled. Our wall clock can be directly used after putting 1 AA ordinary carbon zinc battery (not included in the package). Due to the alkaline battery current too much affect the accuracy. Includes a traceless hook. 🎁【A Warm Gift】: Not only works as a excellent decorative wall clock on living room, study room, kitchens, bars, cafes, but also can be a nice gift for your family or friends on birthdays, weddings, festivals and Anniversaries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GanFXSlFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bengenta","source_asin":"B094QB2XNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094QB2XNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094QB2XNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
