window.products.push({"id":497644,"name":"Smyrna Original Turkish Cloth Napkins Set of 6 | 100% Cotton, 18 x 18 Inches | Decorative Boho Table Napkins for Dining Table | Versatile Cloth Napkin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n8A+YjFAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features of Smyrna Turkish Cloth Napkins ✔ 100% Natural Cotton ✔ Made in Turkey ✔ OEKO-TEX Certified ✔ Vintage Design ✔ Boho and Rustic ✔ Decorative and Stylish ✔ Prewashed ✔ Washable ✔ Quickdry ✔ The Sizes: 18 x 18 Inches ✔ Weight: 16.2 oz ✔ Takes Up Very Little Space ✔ Ultra Soft ✔ Fashionable and Eco Friendly ✔ Free of Harmful Chemicals ✔ Easy to Pack and Carry ✔ Gets Softer After Each Wash Where to Use ✔ Kitchen ✔ Dining Table ✔ Wedding and Parties ✔ In Daily Life. Such as; Tea Towel, Guest Towel, Face Towel, Hair Towel, Dishcloth, Gym Towel, and Wash Cloth Care Instructions - Machine Wash 85-100°F (30-40°C) - Tumble Dry Low or Line Dry. - Do not Bleach - Fabric Softener as Desired - You May Add a Small Amount of White Distilled Vinegar to Keep it Extra Fluffy. - Use a Warm Iron to Smooth out any Unwanted Wrinkles. About OEKO-TEX Certification If a product is labeled as Oeko - Tex certified it is completely free from harmful chemicals and safe for human use. To attain Oeko - Tex Standard 100 certification , the fabric has been tested and certified to be free from harmful levels of more than 100 substances known to be harmful to human health. 3 Reasons to Choose This Turkish Hand Towel by Smyrna Turkish Cotton ★ High Quality ★ Chic and Fashionable ★ 100% WARRANTY","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n8A+YjFAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMYRNA TURKISH COTTON","source_asin":"B09WDSYT4V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WDSYT4V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WDSYT4V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":497645,"name":"Tovolo Flex-Core All Silicone Deep Spoon with Angle Head, Charcoal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OTl+Mgi5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect for scooping, stirring, measure, and more, the Tovolo Flex-Core All Silicone Deep Spoon is an essential in every kitchen. With an all-silicone design, the spoon handles all your kitchen tasks effectively and easily. The nylon Flex-Core design creates essential rigidity, but the silicone coating give the edges just enough flexibility to scrape bowls, basins, pots, and pans clean as you cook. A deep basin holds spices, oils, water, and more, and the 1 tablespoon measurement line encourages accurate cooking. Add what you need, then stir the ingredient into your dish without leaving a drop or granule behind. The angled head scrapes bowls and pans clean, which prevents burning and encourages even cooking while sautéing and simmering. Heat-resistant silicone handles temperatures up to 600⁰F, so you can cook without worry—and the ergonomic handle feel comfortable in your hand as you scoop, stir, sauté, and serve. Silicone spoon measures 1.125\" H X 2.25\" W X 12.5\" D. BPA-free and dishwasher safe. At Tovolo, we believe time spent cooking should be fun. We challenge ourselves to improve the performance, function, and appearance of kitchen tools. We obsess over every detail to ensure that our spatula, spoon, knife, or ice mold will outperform expectations. But performance is not enough—we want to put a smile on your face as you cook. Whether it is our Spatulart silicone spatulas, our assortment of frozen pop molds, or our whimsically shaped ice molds, we add a colorful element of fun to each of our items to remind you how fun it is to cook and share meal with the people you love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OTl+Mgi5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B07WH4D11Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WH4D11Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WH4D11Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
