window.products.push({"id":497682,"name":"Tovolo Silicone Pasta Claw - Stratus Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QfnHV7TPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Making and serving pasta just got easier, thanks to the Tovolo Pasta Claw. The contoured fingers help scoop as much pasta as you like, while a special opening in the center of the claw measures out a single serving of pasta. The claw is safe to use on both nonstick and ceramic surfaces and is dishwasher safe. At Tovolo, we believe time spent cooking should be fun and we are honored to be a part of that experience in each home that uses our products. We challenge ourselves to improve the performance, function, and appearance of kitchen tools. Something as simple as a silicone spatula moves us to create the perfect experience for our customers. We obsess over every detail to ensure that our spatula will outperform expectations. However, performance alone is not enough; we want to put a smile on the customer’s face as well. Whether it is our Spatulart silicone spatulas, our assortment of frozen pop molds or our whimsically shaped ice molds, we strive to add a colorful element of fun to each of our items, to do just that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QfnHV7TPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B00JRXQL7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JRXQL7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JRXQL7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":497683,"name":"Genuine Rainbow D4 Vacuum Cleaner (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":799.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z9wj+FkSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reconditioned Genuine Rainbow D4 Bagless Canister Vacuum Cleaner with highly efficient Water Filtration Technology and is one of the most powerful bagless canister vacuums on the market with an amazing 72 CFM of power! With its 6-Piece Rainbow tool kit, and Reconditioned Genuine D4 Power Head. The D4 power head will clean all your floor types with ease. Since all Rainbow vacuums use a Water Filtration system to keep the air and motor clean, this gives it superior durability compared to other bagless vacuums on the market. This combined with a Top-To-Bottom complete rebuild process and its high quality construction allows it to come with a 5-year limited motor warranty, and 2-year limited Bumper-to-Bumper warranty. The Rebuild Process includes: Complete sanitation of entire unit and any reconditioned items included and replacement of any worn parts. We are in no way associated with the Rexair company, and this was rebuilt by GV and not the Rexair Company. Rainbows are perfect for any home large or small. Any floor type from all carpet types to any hard floor surface. Clean stairs with ease by taking advantage of the Rainbow's extra long hose reach and array of Rainbow attachments. from the power nozzle for carpeted stairs to the combination floor tool on hardwood stairs. Use the Genuine D4 electric power nozzle with No-Slip-Belt to make quick work of your vacuuming needs, quickly transition from carpet to hard-floor surfaces by simply switching between carpet mode and hard-floor mode with the conveniently located handle switch. Effortlessly handle any other cleaning job around the home with the on-board Rainbow Attachment Set, which includes: 1 straight extension wand, 1 curved extension wand, Crevice tool for edge cleaning, Duster Brush for all your dusting needs, Upholstery tool for car interior and upholstery, and a wide path floor tool for all floor types.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z9wj+FkSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B083Q3Q4KK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083Q3Q4KK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083Q3Q4KK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
