window.products.push({"id":497741,"name":"R.H. Forschner 7\" Santoku Granton Knife - 125th Anniversary Edition","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31V8tDdkMPL._AC_.jpg","description":"The R.H. Forschner 7 inch Santoku Granton Knife by Victorinox features a Fibrox handle and extremely sharp blade that holds its edge.This special edition of the Forschner 7 inch Santoku Granton Knife was created to commemorate the 125th Anniversary of Victorinox Swiss Army. The 125th Anniversary Santoku Knife has the words \"125 Years Your Companion For Life\" engraved on the blade.A granton edge, or \"kullenschiff\" edge, has hollowed out grooves on the sides of the blade. These grooves fill with the fat and juices of the product being sliced, which allows for thin, even cuts without tearing or shredding the meat. The patented Fibrox handle is dishwasher safe and slip resistant, even when wet. It is also NSF approved, as crevices that would offer hospitality to bacteria are minimized. As with all R.H. Forschner knives, the handle is ergonomically designed to minimize wrist tension and provides a natural fit. Forschner knives all have high carbon, stainless steel blades that are hand finished at Victorinox in Switzerland by skilled craftsmen. Each knife is stamped from a single sheet of metal. The blade is then hardened, tempered, ground, polished, etched and finished. Victorinox uses a special tempering process to produce an edge that can be resharpened over and over again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31V8tDdkMPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"R.H. FORSCHNER","source_asin":"B00243QMSU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00243QMSU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00243QMSU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
