window.products.push({"id":497834,"name":"Hamilton Beach Glass Electric Tea Kettle, Water Boiler & Heater, 1 L, Cordless, Auto-Shutoff & Boil-Dry Protection, Clear & Twinings of London English","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pnQvb7l0L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Hamilton Beach Glass Electric Tea Kettle, Water Boiler & Heater, 1 L, Cordless, LED Indicator, Auto-Shutoff & Boil-Dry Protection (40930), ClearA shortage of storage space shouldn't prohibit you from the convenience of an electric kettle. With the Hamilton Beach 1 liter electric kettle, water boiler & tea heater with LED indicator, auto-shutoff & boil-dry protection, It's quick and easy to enjoy tea, pour-over coffee, hot chocolate, soups and more in minutes, without compromising valuable counter space. Plus, it has an attractive design that looks great in any kitchen. Even though it's compact, this kettle still packs a lot of features. With 1500 watts, it can boil water faster than a microwave, and is safer to use than a stovetop kettle. When the water reaches a boil, the kettle will automatically turn off, which helps keep it from boiling dry. The kettle lifts right off the base without the cord, making serving at the table a snap. A stay-cool handle, push-button lid and easy-pour spout makes filling and serving easy, maximizing the functionality of this powerful but space-saving kettle.Twinings of London English Breakfast Tea K-Cups for Keurig, 24 Count24 ct. Keurig English Breakfast Tea K-Cup Pods","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pnQvb7l0L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B08CF6Q1FV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CF6Q1FV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CF6Q1FV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
