window.products.push({"id":497915,"name":"6 in 1 Third Pound Burger Pro Press and Store | BPA Free Silicone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f99wNz+eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Burger Pro patty press from Kitchen Logic now makes it easy to prepare the meatiest chunkiest burgers for your next cookout or BBQ. Treat your guests to the delicious 3rd Pound burgers, the way they’re supposed to be! Preparation couldn’t be easier - in 5 easy steps you can instantly make 6 large 1/3 lb burger patties ready to get on the grill or in the pan: 1. Whip up 2 lbs of your favourite mix: ground beef, chicken, veggies – the choice is yours! 2. Divide into six equal balls and place into the Burger Pro tray. 3. Carefully line up the lid and push into place firmly until both parts are fully together. 4. Immediately chill or freeze (or use if you’re ready to go!) 5. Spin your Burger Pro upside down and remove the tray – your patties are ready to go in the lid! With Burger Pro you will always be serving up thick, juicy extra large patties. Burger Pro’s large size patties ensure that you’ll be making classic perfect shaped burgers that are easy to handle on the grill so flipping is no problem! They won’t get lost in a bun and sure can take whatever you throw on them – cheese, bacon, onions, pickles – you name it! Once frozen, Burger Pro is an awesome way to store your burger ready for your next cook out. Flat stackable, you can easily keep multiple Burger Pros in your freezer or transport in a cooler with your patties ready to go on the move. The large size cups also make cleaning easy and safe with no small or moving parts. 100% dishwasher safe and BPA free mean that you can cook clean and safe. Burger Pro is also made with heavy-duty food grade silicone and comes with Kitchen Logic’s Lifetime Satisfaction Guarantee. Get Burger Pro today and start grilling the biggest, juiciest burgers at your next cook out. Why stay small and risk dry patties that fall apart? GO BIG – Go Burger Pro! Burger Pro, by Kitchen Logic. Food that makes sense.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f99wNz+eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aniyoo","source_asin":"B01FH81GJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FH81GJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FH81GJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
