window.products.push({"id":497970,"name":"Ivation Premium Stainless Steel 18 Bottle Thermoelectric Wine Cooler/Chiller Counter Top Red & White Wine Cellar w/Digital Temperature, Freestanding R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717ID3DilDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ivation 18 Bottle Stainless Steel Wine Cooler keeps your wine at the correct & consistent temperature and stable environment, protecting the wine from exterior lights and elements, and is specially built to have zero vibration, so the wine could be aged and stored properly, enabling it to preserve and develop its delicious flavor, Color and Aroma, with the best possible mouthfeel, body, palette and finish, serving you the best and tastiest wine that is Full, Rich, Supple, Smooth, Round, and Balanced A Must Have for Wine Lovers and Collectors The only way to properly protect your wine is to store them in the Ivation temperature-controlled beautifully designed stainless steel wine cooler, even for short term storage. Serving temperature has a big effect on how a wine smells, tastes and feels in your mouth, even a very good wine can be awful at the wrong temperature, likewise improper temperature can also shorten the wine’s life or ruin the wine completely, Regular refrigerators are not an option, as they are too cold for most wines, and “Room temperature” is too warm. Features & Specifications Maintains the perfect temperature for red and white wines Efficient thermoelectric cooling Low noise, low vibration – will not disturb sediment Digital control panel and LCD display Soft interior lighting with on/off control Tempered smoked glass door with stainless steel trim Pull-out premium oak wood shelves Solid, CFC-free polyurethane foam insulation Rated Power: 65W Temperature Range: 54º – 64ºF Weight: Net: 32 lbs Unit Dimensions: 13.5\" x 20\" x 25.4\" Importent Tip: Do not put your wine cooler in the garage. It will work best in a 72ºF room temperature environment. Buy with confidence: If you need any help regarding any of our products don’t hesitate to contact our dedicated customer service team at info@myivation.com or call 866-849-3049","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717ID3DilDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivation","source_asin":"B07CTTSBCV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CTTSBCV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CTTSBCV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
